---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Charlie Herbozo-Vidal" passwordProtected={false}>
  <div class="about-page-wrap">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="about-columns">
      <div class="about-photo-wrap">
        <img src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Charlie Herbozo-Vidal" class="about-photo" />
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Hi, I'm Charlie!</p>
        <p>
          Whether I'm designing a digital ecosystem, engineering a solution, or baking a loaf of
          sourdough, I am driven by a love for the process of creation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Based in New York City by way of Lima, Peru, I am a hybrid Creative Lead, Engineer, and
          Business Strategist. Instead of narrowing my focus to just one discipline, I've spent my
          career mastering how they connect.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over the past few years, I've focused on optimizing omnichannel user experiences across
          retail pharmacy, convenience, and e-commerce sectors. My work includes shaping the
          strategy for large-scale, nationwide design modernization efforts that successfully
          aligned cross-functional teams and drove measurable business value.
        </p>
        <p>
          My expertise lies in translating complex business goals into seamless, customer-centric
          digital experiences. I approach every challenge with deep curiosity and a collaborative
          mindset, and I'm always looking for innovative teams ready to elevate their user experience
          and scale their impact.
        </p>
        <p>Let's connect!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
